    {
      "id": 2,
      "keys": [],
      "secondary_keys": [],
      "comment": "[mvu_update]变量输出格式",
      "content": "变量输出格式:\n  rule:\n    - you must output the update analysis and the actual update commands at once in the end of the next reply\n    - the update commands works like the **JSON Patch (RFC 6902)** standard, must be a valid JSON array containing operation objects\n    - supported operations: replace, delta, insert, remove\n    - don't update field names starts with `_` as they are readonly\n\n  format: |-\n    <UpdateVariable>\n    <Analysis>$(IN ENGLISH, no more than 80 words)\n    - ${calculate time passed: ...}\n    - ${analyze tenant/room changes based on current reply: ...}\n    - ${analyze relationship updates: ...}\n    </Analysis>\n    <JSONPatch>\n    [\n      { \"op\": \"replace\", \"path\": \"${/path/to/variable}\", \"value\": \"${new_value}\" },\n      { \"op\": \"delta\", \"path\": \"${/path/to/number/variable}\", \"value\": \"${positive_or_negative_delta}\" },\n      { \"op\": \"insert\", \"path\": \"${/path/to/object/new_key}\", \"value\": \"${new_value}\" },\n      { \"op\": \"remove\", \"path\": \"${/path/to/item}\" },\n      ...\n    ]\n    </JSONPatch>\n    </UpdateVariable>\n\n  examples:\n    新租客入住: |-\n      <UpdateVariable>\n      <Analysis>\n      - Time: 2 hours passed, now 17:44\n      - New tenant: 张小雪 moved into 三楼房间一\n      - Room update: assign 张小雪 to 三楼房间一\n      </Analysis>\n      <JSONPatch>\n      [\n        { \"op\": \"replace\", \"path\": \"/世界/时间\", \"value\": \"17:44\" },\n        { \"op\": \"insert\", \"path\": \"/租客列表/张小雪\", \"value\": { \"年龄\": 22, \"外貌\": \"黑长直少女\", \"职业\": \"大学生\", \"性格\": \"温柔内向\", \"状态\": \"正常\", \"内心\": \"对新环境有些紧张\", \"关系\": { \"<user>\": \"房东\" } } },\n        { \"op\": \"insert\", \"path\": \"/公寓/房间列表/三楼房间一\", \"value\": { \"类型\": \"卧室\", \"名称\": \"三楼房间一\", \"楼层\": \"三楼\", \"位置\": \"1-3\", \"住户\": \"张小雪\", \"描述\": \"张小雪的房间\" } }\n      ]\n      </JSONPatch>\n      </UpdateVariable>\n\n    时间流逝: |-\n      <UpdateVariable>\n      <Analysis>\n      - Time: next day morning\n      - Date change: 9月25日, 星期二\n      </Analysis>\n      <JSONPatch>\n      [\n        { \"op\": \"replace\", \"path\": \"/世界/日期\", \"value\": \"9月25日\" },\n        { \"op\": \"replace\", \"path\": \"/世界/星期\", \"value\": \"星期二\" },\n        { \"op\": \"replace\", \"path\": \"/世界/时间\", \"value\": \"08:00\" }\n      ]\n      </JSONPatch>\n      </UpdateVariable>\n\n    租客退租: |-\n      <UpdateVariable>\n      <Analysis>\n      - Tenant 张小雪 moved out\n      - Room 三楼房间一 is now empty\n      </Analysis>\n      <JSONPatch>\n      [\n        { \"op\": \"remove\", \"path\": \"/租客列表/张小雪\" },\n        { \"op\": \"replace\", \"path\": \"/公寓/房间列表/三楼房间一/住户\", \"value\": \"无\" }\n      ]\n      </JSONPatch>\n      </UpdateVariable>\n\n    租客状态更新: |-\n      <UpdateVariable>\n      <Analysis>\n      - 张小雪's mental state changed after conversation\n      </Analysis>\n      <JSONPatch>\n      [\n        { \"op\": \"replace\", \"path\": \"/租客列表/张小雪/状态\", \"value\": \"开心\" },\n        { \"op\": \"replace\", \"path\": \"/租客列表/张小雪/内心\", \"value\": \"和房东聊得很愉快\" }\n      ]\n      </JSONPatch>\n      </UpdateVariable>\n\n    新建房间: |-\n      <UpdateVariable>\n      <Analysis>\n      - Room creation: new bedroom at 三楼, position 4-6\n      </Analysis>\n      <JSONPatch>\n      [\n        { \"op\": \"insert\", \"path\": \"/公寓/房间列表/三楼新房间\", \"value\": { \"类型\": \"卧室\", \"名称\": \"三楼新房间\", \"楼层\": \"三楼\", \"位置\": \"4-6\", \"住户\": \"无\", \"描述\": \"新建的卧室\" } }\n      ]\n      </JSONPatch>\n      </UpdateVariable>\n\n    装修空房间为卧室: |-\n      <UpdateVariable>\n      <Analysis>\n      - Room renovation: 三楼空房间 -> 卧室\n      </Analysis>\n      <JSONPatch>\n      [\n        { \"op\": \"replace\", \"path\": \"/公寓/房间列表/三楼空房间/类型\", \"value\": \"卧室\" }\n      ]\n      </JSONPatch>\n      </UpdateVariable>\n\n    装修为功能性房间: |-\n      <UpdateVariable>\n      <Analysis>\n      - Room renovation: 三楼空房间 -> 功能性房间 (书房)\n      </Analysis>\n      <JSONPatch>\n      [\n        { \"op\": \"replace\", \"path\": \"/公寓/房间列表/三楼空房间/类型\", \"value\": \"功能性房间\" },\n        { \"op\": \"replace\", \"path\": \"/公寓/房间列表/三楼空房间/名称\", \"value\": \"书房\" }\n      ]\n      </JSONPatch>\n      </UpdateVariable>\n\n    拆除房间: |-\n      <UpdateVariable>\n      <Analysis>\n      - Room demolition: 三楼书房 removed\n      </Analysis>\n      <JSONPatch>\n      [\n        { \"op\": \"remove\", \"path\": \"/公寓/房间列表/三楼书房\" }\n      ]\n      </JSONPatch>\n      </UpdateVariable>\n\n    合租入住: |-\n      <UpdateVariable>\n      <Analysis>\n      - New tenant: 林诗涵 moves into 三楼房间一 (shared with 张小雪)\n      - Room update: add 林诗涵 to existing occupant list\n      </Analysis>\n      <JSONPatch>\n      [\n        { \"op\": \"replace\", \"path\": \"/世界/时间\", \"value\": \"16:30\" },\n        { \"op\": \"insert\", \"path\": \"/租客列表/林诗涵\", \"value\": { \"年龄\": 20, \"外貌\": \"温柔长发少女\", \"职业\": \"音乐系学生\", \"性格\": \"温柔善良\", \"状态\": \"正常\", \"内心\": \"期待和室友相处\", \"关系\": { \"<user>\": \"房东\", \"张小雪\": \"室友\" } } },\n        { \"op\": \"replace\", \"path\": \"/公寓/房间列表/三楼房间一/住户\", \"value\": \"张小雪、林诗涵\" },\n        { \"op\": \"replace\", \"path\": \"/公寓/房间列表/三楼房间一/描述\", \"value\": \"张小雪和林诗涵的合租房间\" }\n      ]\n      </JSONPatch>\n      </UpdateVariable>\n\n    合租房退租一人: |-\n      <UpdateVariable>\n      <Analysis>\n      - Tenant 林诗涵 moved out from shared room 三楼房间一\n      - 张小雪 remains in the room\n      </Analysis>\n      <JSONPatch>\n      [\n        { \"op\": \"remove\", \"path\": \"/租客列表/林诗涵\" },\n        { \"op\": \"replace\", \"path\": \"/公寓/房间列表/三楼房间一/住户\", \"value\": \"张小雪\" },\n        { \"op\": \"replace\", \"path\": \"/公寓/房间列表/三楼房间一/描述\", \"value\": \"张小雪的房间\" }\n      ]\n      </JSONPatch>\n      </UpdateVariable>\n\n    错误示范_租客临时使用其他房间: |-\n      注意！以下是【错误】的做法，绝对不要这样写！\n      租客去厨房做饭、去客厅看电视等日常行为，不需要也不允许修改住户字段。\n      ✖ 错误: { \"op\": \"replace\", \"path\": \"/公寓/房间列表/厨房/住户\", \"value\": \"张小雪\" }\n      ✖ 错误: { \"op\": \"replace\", \"path\": \"/公寓/房间列表/三楼房间一/住户\", \"value\": \"无\" }\n      ✓ 正确: 不输出任何住户相关的变量更新，只在剧情文本中描写租客的行动\n\n    新建楼层: |-\n      <UpdateVariable>\n      <Analysis>\n      - Floor creation: 五楼 added above existing floors\n      </Analysis>\n      <JSONPatch>\n      [\n        { \"op\": \"insert\", \"path\": \"/公寓/楼层列表/0\", \"value\": \"五楼\" }\n      ]\n      </JSONPatch>\n      </UpdateVariable>",
      "constant": true,
      "selective": true,
